[20.100906, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[1;36m❯\u001b[0m Next : \u001b[1;32mcd ./my-app && claude\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  Then drive the 6-phase workflow with one command :\r\n  \u001b[1;33m/work:work-flow-feature \"add a /counter route\"\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2;37mgithub.com/christopherlouet/claude-base\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
